	(text "03 Feedback: one network per channel (PI-3, sim/pi_nfb): relay (G6K-2F-Y, NO contacts) at the 8 ohm end -> Rf 100k || Cf 22p -> Cres 22n || resonance pot (front panel, W30-W32) -> network node -> NJFET T-switch -> common feedback node (second grid's cap); presence 1k + pot + 22n from the network node. Rbot 4.7k stays on the common node (no network = no feedback, grid still returned)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
